(CLAUSE 1: Para 16 \(Mandatory Culverts & Unobstructed Cross-Drainage\)) Tj T*
(Real-estate layouts, industrial parks, and road-widening projects in Thiruporur) Tj T*
(and Kattankolathur blocks shall not obstruct or narrow natural overland flow paths) Tj T*
(or inter-tank supply channels connecting Thaiyur, Siruseri, Kelambakkam, and) Tj T*
(Paiyanur eris.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CLAUSE 2: Para 19 \(Revocation of Planning Permission on Tank Foreshores\)) Tj T*
(Planning authorities \(CMDA / DTCP\) and Village Panchayats are prohibited from) Tj T*
(granting building approvals within the Full Tank Level \(FTL\) or statutory buffer) Tj T*
